<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Hona Bible *</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Korontiyaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Korontiyaya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya a har Mbulus, tǝthlǝnda Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti wurna Faara, tǝ wan manǝm Timoti, a nafiya Faara na a Koronti, heu tǝ nafiya Faara na chahal a Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />A tsauka nggayirha tǝ ɗǝɗemnggid Faara Chinǝm tǝ yi Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a nagha tǝ kun.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usa Mbulus Faara na a nggab fiya heu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Parka yi Faara ni, Chin Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, Chinɗi na fiya haɗang fa, tǝ nggab farha. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Nggab ƙǝm hu sǝsad nǝm heu, tǝ nǝm mbang nggab fingya ahu sǝsaarha na nanda sǝ, tǝ tur nggabrha ƙǝm wal nǝm a fad Faara. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝla mul na sǝsad Ƙǝrǝsti hai a kǝm, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm mul nggabrǝ nǝm hai ka Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />A naɗan a sǝsaarha, nan a saghǝn fa ka nggabrǝ nun, tǝ hǝrǝkrǝ nun, a wal ɗan nggabrha, wal nan ndǝn ka nggabrǝ nun, na a fǝrang ƙǝrǝsta kun hu tur sǝsadɗi nǝm a saarha fa ya. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Na shiiten nan tǝ kun kanglang, sǝnɗansǝ ƙǝla nanun a wum teena tǝ kan hu sǝsad nan, nuwun kee ƙǝm a wum teena tǝ kan hu nggabrǝ nan. <verse eid="2CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Shayina, mbǝ minna sǝ a tsawun tǝ yamid sǝnda wa, aten sǝsaarha saanan fa a Asiya. Sǝsaaɗan kaan, kalgha kan mu, har takh ɗan a mǝra. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Kan ndaghan kee nan a mǝra. Amma katǝra nǝn hai kee ƙǝsǝr a malanggan mbǝrsarha tǝ alten nan mbǝrsan tǝ Faara, na a thleng mǝrya sǝ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ndǝghǝn hǝrghangga kan sǝ hu tur sǝsad mǝrrǝ ɗiya, ndǝghǝnni ƙǝm na a nggǝr hǝrghang kan. Ndǝghǝn ndǝn shang nan teena fa nǝn a nggǝr hǝrghang kan, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />a sayidɗi nun a ɗang kansǝ tǝ hwan Faara aten nan. Nanǝn kee, fiya hangga na nda a usa Faara a meyed nan, ƙǝsǝr ka parkadɗi ǝnang nanda kan, thlǝna Faara hwanda fiya hangga ǝna nanda a tennan.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakhrang Mbulus hutenggǝn hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />ˈYa ǝnagha ndǝn nanan a taala, fǝr huten nan shedawa tǝ ndaarha tsawud nan hu ƙǝshidɗiya nǝghǝn chahal tǝ hura tal mbǝ ƙǝla tsawud nan tǝ kun mawa, ǝnaghan ndǝn tǝ mbǝrsarha tǝ nggayid Faara, mbǝ tǝ thladwayid ƙǝshiirha wa. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Chireethleng ngwan ˈya kun ɗǝ mbuwa nun mbang karatang sǝnanggun hai wa. Niyi a shiteena tǝ ndaarha, a fara sǝmǝn ɓanun a sǝnang hai ngga, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />ƙǝla katǝrang nun sǝnang ǝnggina hai ya. A fara na Yeeso a wutta ɓa ɓanun sǝnang ǝnggina hai ngga, non a taala tǝ kan, ƙǝla nanan ƙǝm a taala tǝ kun. <verse eid="2CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ƙǝsǝr nggǝmɗi fa kee, ndǝghǝn ni na katǝra ɓarha thlǝmad nun ɓa, na a wal parka nun katǝra sǝri. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Na minnasǝ a weng tala ni kun a naɗi a ɗǝrha Makidoniya ɗǝ, nggǝryi kyarha tǝ thlǝmad nun a naɗi a wutta ɓa a makidoniya, na minnasǝ ƙǝm a ɗeewun sǝ a naɗi a ɗǝrha Yahudiya ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Nun a numad ndaarha hu ngwad ɗi kyana ya sǝngwi ˈya niya ǝnaarha wa? Nduwa nuwun a naghǝn ngwa ni fa yi thlu farha, a ndee, “Yo” nggǝryi wutta ɓa ndee, “Awo” wa? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ƙǝla nana Faara tǝ ƙǝkafek fa, ˈya nanan a thlǝghang nda kun mbǝ naarha a pathlang “Yo” tǝ “Awo” wa. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ƙǝsǝr Wan Faara, Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, nggi, tǝ Sila tǝ Timoti pǝrang nan laɓarghǝn kun, mbǝ “Yo” sǝ tǝ “Awo” wa, ˈya tsauka yi Faara “Yo” ni ƙǝtsar. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ƙǝsǝr ɗǝfmi Faara heu nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa hu Ƙǝrǝsti, tǝ ndarha “Yo”, tǝ ƙǝm hu Ƙǝrǝsti nǝm ndaarha, “Atsaukake”, a mamnggit Faara. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Faara ndǝn wumangga kan tǝ kun ishim tǝ shembe hu Ƙǝrǝsti. Ndǝghǝnni wurgha kan, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />ndǝghǝn ɗǝfangga njaara ƙǝm fa hu ndaarha ƙǝm yighǝn ni. Tǝ ƙǝm ndǝghǝn ni fǝrangga Sǝsǝnggǝn ƙǝm ahur nǝm hai hu ndaarha kala ˈya ndaanǝn ɓa nǝm walghǝn a mbee. <verse eid="2CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Faara ndǝna shedawanna ndani ƙǝsǝr a nggǝr ɗi chighang sǝsaarha kun wa ndǝghǝn wudwa ni Korinti ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Mbǝ nanan a ngyaɓang kun hu ˈya hai nun a fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn wa, amma nanan a ǝna taara heu tǝ kun, ƙǝsǝr ka wutsǝfayid nun, aten ƙǝkafekkid nun ni ƙǝm, ish nun tǝ shembe.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Nanǝn kee, niyi a numad ndaarha mbi nggǝr weng tala kun na a ɗang sǝbgha hura ni kun ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ƙǝsǝr a sǝɓang ɗi hur nun ɗǝ, wunni takhka na a fǝre wutsǝfayirha nǝn, a mbǝ kun sǝɓang ni hur nun ɗǝ wa? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ndǝn ɗa Chireethleng ni kun ɗǝ ƙǝla ni tǝ ǝnaarha, nǝn ɗǝ tsaurha a ɓa ɗi ɓa, a sǝb hurna ɗǝ tǝ fingyayini na fǝree wutsǝfayirha wa. Ƙǝkafek sǝnɗun sǝ heu wutsǝfayid na nǝn kyarha ɓa ahu wutsǝfayid nun. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ƙǝsǝr chireethleng nggi kun ɗǝ nggi hu ɓillarha har tǝ amyirha kaan, mbǝ ka a kyanggi kun hu sǝbrha hura hai wa, awo, ƙǝsǝr ka a kyaɗang nggǝmndǝna ni kun.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakh ɗimiyirha a niifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />A ɓang niifa sǝbrha hura ɓa, mbǝ nggi katenna ɓang nǝn ndǝn ɓa wa, amma ɓang nǝn ndǝn kun ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Niifɗiya, tsǝtsǝlla ǝnang na fiya hangga ahur nun tsǝk ɗǝ kee. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Nanǝnya, a nggushi chahang nun ndǝn ɗǝ, tǝ kǝm nggab wunun, naɗǝ sǝbrha hura kaan kalghǝn mu. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ƙǝsǝr kakee, niya hwan kun, nggǝra man kyaɗang nggǝmndǝ nun. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ənɗi ǝnagha ndǝn chireethleng ni kun ɗǝ tǝni sǝndasǝ tǝnun mbang ƙǝrǝsta tǝ ƙǝƙǝrrǝɗi ya, non ƙǝm a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya ndang ni kun. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />A chahang ɗun ɗimiyirha kowunni ɗǝ, nggi ƙǝm chahang ɗi ndǝn ɗǝ. Ənɗi chahang ni ndǝn ɗǝ kamanggǝn, ana ˈyasǝ pak kamngga a changgǝnǝm ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr ka kun ni chahang ni ndǝn ɗǝ a mbed Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Ənani kee naɗǝ Sheetan ɗathlang ƙǝm fa. Tsaunǝn sǝnɗǝm thladwayidghǝn heu.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fatarya weerǝnda ɗǝfmee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />A sayidɗi ɓani a Toruwas ɓa ka ɓi pǝr Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn yi Ƙǝrǝsti, wal ɗi ine Chinǝm kwamana hai. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Amma hunawa hurna hai wa ƙǝsǝr ɗǝwi wal wanmana Titus a mbǝɗi wa. Nanǝn kee mal fingya fatakkwaya ni ɗi Makidoniya ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Usaarha a Faara na ɗang ƙǝmsǝ tǝ wal hǝbrha hu Ƙǝrǝsti. Faara ƙǝm a ɗang ƙǝmsǝ hu pǝr sǝnda Ƙǝrǝsti nǝm ko a yanggini, sǝndǝɗiya ƙǝm nǝghǝn ƙǝla sǝd urdi. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ƙǝsǝr a fad Faara kǝm sǝd Ƙǝrǝsti ni hu fingya walgha hǝrǝkrha, tǝ fingya sahadgha. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />A wumten fingya, sǝd mǝrra ni, a fingya ƙǝm, sǝd yibrha ni. Wunni tsǝkka na a ǝna tur tarɗa nǝn ya? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Mban a tsam Laɓar Faara ka a wal chikrha nan ƙǝla na fingya hangga ǝnaarha wa. A meyedghǝn, naghan a thlǝk Ƙǝrǝsti a mbed Faara tǝ ƙǝkafek, ƙǝla nafini thlǝnna nda kanda ɓa a thlǝmad Faara.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Nǝm a nggǝr fal ten nǝm faɗǝn wa, nduwa na mid nan ɗeleewar faala a kun, nduwa a haar nun wa? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Kun tǝ altennun kunni ɗeleewar nan, yanɗi chireethleng nanda hai ahur nun, ƙǝsǝr kowunni a sǝnggǝnǝn, tǝƙǝm karatanggǝn. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Kyad ɗun ndaarha kun ɗeleewar ni ɓagha ɓa a kii Ƙǝrǝsti, ƙǝsǝr ka tar nan, mbǝ yanɗi chirethleng nanda hai tǝ ashilee wa, ƙǝl yanɗi na tǝ Sǝsǝn Faara na tǝ yibrha. Mbǝ aten feera wa, ƙǝl yanɗi na ahur fiya. <verse eid="2CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Hǝhasyid ɗiya ndǝn nanǝm tǝghǝn hu Ƙǝrǝsti a mbed Faara. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm mbang kyatta tǝ ndaarha tǝ mbang ndǝ nan ni nana ǝna tarɗi ya wa. Mbang ndǝ nan kyaghǝn ɓa a haar Faara. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ndǝghǝn ni fǝrangga mbang nda kan hu tsawud nan fa tarya weerǝnda ɗǝfmee mbǝ tǝ yanɗi na chichireethlee hai wa, amma yi Sǝsǝna, ƙǝsǝr chireelth ɗi, nǝn ɓǝl farha, Sǝsǝna ƙǝm nǝn fǝr yibrha. <verse eid="2CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ana tarɗi ɓang mǝrra ɓa chireethleng nanda hai aten feera, ɓaɗa ɓa tǝ mamnggirha kaan har mbangwa Isǝreelaya ƙǝlang yid Musa wa ƙǝsǝr ka kukwaryidghǝn paɗigha hai kaan, ko nanǝn mbǝrɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Mbǝ mamnggit tar Sǝsǝna kal yanɗi mamnggirha ya wa? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ana tarɗi na a ɓang ngwa kumarha fiya tǝ mamnggirha kaan kiya, taara na a ɓang nggayirha ɓa nǝn a naarha manggǝn kaan. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ƙǝsǝr ˈya kaar na tǝ mamnggirha fa kaan, mbǝ mamnggirha sǝ a fadghǝn nanǝnya wa, a ƙǝƙǝrang ɗǝm tǝ mamnggirha nanǝm tǝghǝn nanǝnya. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ana ˈya na mbǝraɗǝ tǝ mamnggirha fa, yi pakwanɗǝ, ƙǝkafek nǝn naarha tǝ mamnggirha fa kaan. <verse eid="2CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Tsaunǝn nǝghǝm tǝ shiteena kiya, mbǝ tǝrǝmnda sǝ a fad nan wa. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Mban ƙǝla Musa wa, lǝlǝɓangga yidghǝn amana Isǝreelaya naa mamnggit djarra kukwaryidɗi na a mbǝraɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Amma tsǝ hur ndan kakrak ta weeri ɗaɓa ya, ɓalgha lǝlǝbrha ten ɗa sǝ a nanda karata ɗeleewar ngyakhrha. Ƙǝl hu Ƙǝrǝsti ni kee katenggǝn ndǝna lǝlǝbrha ten ɗi haara ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ta weeri ɗaɓa ya, kala sayi a nanda a karata ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa, lǝlǝɓǝdɗi ya nǝn nggǝlang hur ndan. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Amma a sayidɗi kyaharna niifa thlǝmad Chinǝm ɓa, na lǝlǝɓǝdɗi a haara ɗǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Chinǝm ndǝna Sǝsǝna, kala mbǝrha na Sǝsǝn Chinǝm sǝ, a mbǝɗa ni na wal alteena sǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Kan heu harang nanda lǝlǝɓǝɗ ɗa ɗǝ a tennan naghan a kyad mamnggit Chinǝm, na kyakhrang kan hai tsawan ƙǝla ndǝghǝn, hu mamnggirha yi chikrha, ƙǝsǝr ɓaghǝn ɓa a fad Chinǝm na Sǝsǝna.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝna hu wuchiwilteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nanǝn kee, ka haɗang nǝm Faara fa ndǝn na nǝm tǝ tarɗi ya, mbǝ fad nǝm a mǝra hai wa. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Kar ɗan tar ǝn shilee fa na ɓǝɓee, mban hukrha wa, nduwa nggaɓan hai tǝ laɓar Faara wa, a meyedghǝn naghan a pǝr ƙǝkafekkirha a pǝpal. Nan pǝr ƙǝkafek a mbed Faara kowunni na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa nǝn a sǝnggǝnǝn. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ko nana laɓarɗi nan a pǝra nǝghǝn ɓǝɓee, nǝn naarha ɓǝɓee kee a fingya na a sahatta. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Sheetan faara yi ƙǝshidɗiya tsang ɗǝ hur nafiya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek kakrak, amawa nanda naa kukwaryid laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn na a kyad mamnggit Ƙǝrǝsti, ndǝghǝn na ƙǝla Faara. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ƙǝsǝr laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn nan a pǝra mbǝ yi alten nan ni wa, nan a pǝr ndaarha Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ndǝna Chinǝm, kan ƙǝm mafayinun ni ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara ndǝn ndagha, “Ngwa yangga kukwaryirha hai hu wula,” ndǝghǝn ni yangga hai ahur nǝm, ka a fǝrang kukwaryid sǝnda nǝn ƙǝm aten mamnggit Faara hu yid Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Amma nǝghǝm tǝ tur ƙǝnaɗi ˈyahu wuchihulteya, ka a kyad mamnggit ǝnwulten sǝsǝmndǝ ɗa nǝn ya kyaghǝn ɓa a thlǝmad Faara mbǝ a fad nan wa. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Sǝsang nda kan ko tǝ manggi ni, amma kalwanda kan mu wa, ko sǝngwa nan ˈya nan a ǝnaarha, malang ngwan shiiten nan wa. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Sǝsang nda kan, amma kar wa Faara kan wa, ɗǝghang nda kan hweeɗe hai, amma ɓǝlang ngwanda kan wa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ƙǝtsar nǝghǝm a wiirha hai tǝ mǝrra Yeeso ahu farha, tǝnǝm kyad tsawud Yeeso a fad nǝm. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ƙǝm ɓalgha tǝ yibrha fa, ƙǝtsar tsawud mǝrra nanǝm sǝ ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso, tǝna nda naa tsawud Yeeso hu fadɗi kyanǝm ya yi mǝrra. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Nanǝn kee, mǝrra nǝghǝn a ǝna taara ahur nan, amma yibrha nǝghǝn a ǝna taara ahur nun. <verse eid="2CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai tǝ ndaarha, “Fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek, ndǝn kal ni sǝ.” Tsaunǝn nǝghǝm heu tǝ sǝsǝn fǝrƙǝkafek, ndǝn fǝr nan ƙǝkafek ƙǝm kal nan sǝ. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝm ndaarha ndǝghǝn ni thlengga Chinǝm Yeeso sǝ hu mǝrra, nǝn a thleng ƙǝmsǝ heu tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti, nǝn a ɓang ƙǝm a mbedghǝn ɓa heu tǝ kun. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ənggini heu ya ka a ɗanggǝn kun sǝ ni, ƙǝla na nggayid Faara a weela ten fiyaɗǝ hangga, na usaarha a naarha sǝ kaan yi manang nda Faara.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsaurha tǝ ƙǝkafekkirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Tsaunǝn kee, mǝrwa fad nan hai wa. Ko nanǝn fad nǝm na yi mǝra nǝn sǝbrha ɗǝ, amma a hura na fad nǝm naarha nggǝra hai kala parra fara. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Sǝsadɗi kyanǝm ya nǝghǝn ngguchit mbǝ kwas mbǝra ɗǝ wa. Ndǝghǝn ni na a walang mamnggirha ƙǝmsǝ mbuwa ngwalarha mbuwa nǝm mbang sakhƙǝn. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ ǝngya na yirha a naarha ndǝn nǝm a ƙǝlang wa, ƙǝl fingya mbuwa nǝm naarha. Ƙǝsǝr ǝngya nǝm a naarha mba nda kwas mbǝraɗǝ wa, fingya mbuwa nǝm naarha ƙǝm, nǝn tsaurha pakwanɗǝ.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mbǝd tsawud nǝm a talara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝmsǝ a chang nda chamɗa hai kyanǝm yi ƙǝshidɗiya, na tǝn ndǝnǝm sǝ a thlǝmad Faara, ƙǝnna a talara mbuwa tam chaarha hai yi pakwanɗǝ, tǝn ngwana niifa tǝ haara. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ƙǝsǝr hu chamɗi ya nǝm chichimnda, nagha a kukwasang ƙǝm fa kyangganda ƙǝm hu wuriɗa hai kyanǝm na a talara ƙǝla kalla lukrha. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ƙǝsǝr a ngwang nda ƙǝm fa tǝghǝn, mba nda ɓa wal ƙǝm tawalth wa. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />A sayidɗi ɓal nǝm hu chamɗi ya, nǝm naarha chichimnda ƙǝsǝr ka ɓillarha nanǝm sǝ, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ nana minnǝm sǝ a kalang ngganda luwudɗa hai a fad nǝm ya wa, amma ka a ngwang ngganda ƙǝm fa tǝ yi talara, ƙǝsǝr ˈya na mǝmǝra nǝn wal yibrha. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Faara ndǝn ǝnagha ƙǝm a tsawum kiya, ndǝghǝn fǝrangga Sǝsǝna ƙǝm a meyed ǝn ɗǝfrha ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr ka ˈya na ɓayi a mbee. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Tsaunǝn kee, nǝghǝm tǝ hǝhasyirha fa ƙǝtsar. Sǝnɗǝmsǝ tǝ ndaarha, tsawud nǝm hu ƙǝshidɗi ya, nǝghǝm ndǝndǝgha hai tǝ Chinǝm. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ƙǝsǝr tsawud fǝrƙǝkafekkirha nanǝm sǝ, mbǝ yi naarha tǝ yirha wa. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Nǝghǝm tǝ hǝhasyirha fa tǝ ƙǝm na mid nǝm sǝ ndǝkrha hai tǝ fadɗi ya, ɗǝm tsaurha tǝ Chinǝm a talara. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Nanǝn kee na mid nǝm a ǝna ˈya nǝm na a mbǝnanggǝn, ko nǝghǝm hu fadɗi ya, ko mbuwum sǝ wa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝm heu tǝta ni a wumǝm hai a mbed tsǝnggam ngwa kumad Ƙǝrǝsti, ƙǝsǝr kowunni nǝn a wal ƙǝna ǝnɗi ǝna nǝn hu fadɗi ya, ko nǝghǝn ngga, ko mbǝ ngga wa.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laɓar shaulirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nanǝn kee, hǝrǝm nǝm sǝn tǝ mani tǝrǝm Chinǝm, nǝghǝm a djitiirha a lǝm fiya nǝm ɓa. Ƙǝsǝr sǝn Faara ƙǝm kwarkwar, niyi a shiiten ndaarha sǝnɗun kan ahur nun. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Mbǝ nanan a nggǝr fal fad nan a kun wa, amma ka a fǝrang kwamana nan kun non a taala tǝ kan, tǝnun nggǝrang fingya yina sǝ na a taala tǝ ˈya nǝm a naarha tǝ yirha kee, ma yi hura. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />A tsauɗǝ ƙǝla sauta nǝm ni, ƙǝsǝr ka Faara ni, ana huten nan mǝmǝl, ƙǝsǝr ka kun ni. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Nggǝmnda Ƙǝrǝsti ndǝn kyaɗangga kwamana ƙǝm, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝmsǝ, mǝr niifa ka fiya heu, tsaunǝn kee mǝr nda ɗǝ heu. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Mǝr nǝn ka fiya heu, tsaunǝn kee fingya ɓalgha hai mba nda tsaurha ka fad ndan ɓal wa, amma a niifɗi mǝrgha ka kanda, nggǝr nanda thleng sǝ. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Nanǝn kee, nanǝnya ta mbeeɗǝ, mban nggǝr tǝr niifa yi ƙǝshiirha ni wa. Ko nanǝn kaar tǝrghan Ƙǝrǝsti kee, amma nanǝnya mban nggǝr ǝnaarha kee wa. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nanǝn kee, kala niifa na hu Ƙǝrǝsti, tsauɗǝ weerǝnda niifa, hurad ǝngya heu mbǝr ɗaɗǝ, kyad weerǝndǝghǝn ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ənggini heu ya Faara ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn, ndǝghǝn ni ǝnangga shaulirha ƙǝm tǝghǝn hu Ƙǝrǝsti, fǝrang tar shaulirha nǝn kan a fiya, <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Shauli Faara ƙǝshiirha ta fadghǝn hu Ƙǝrǝsti, kirasang ngwa ɗimiyid fiya aten ndan wa, ndǝghǝn fǝrangga laɓar shaulirha ƙǝm. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Nanǝn kee, fathlǝngya ni ƙǝm yi Ƙǝrǝsti, ƙǝla na Faara a ndikrha tǝ ƙǝm. Nan a hwan kun a meyed Ƙǝrǝsti, shaulima tǝ Faara. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Sǝngwa Ƙǝrǝsti ɗimiyirha wa, kyang Faara hu ɗimiyirha hai ƙǝsǝr ka ƙǝm, tǝnǝm wal nggayid Faara.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nanan a ǝna taara tǝ Faara naghan a hwan kun a thlǝɗun nggayid Faara mere wa. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝn, “Sǝkɗi fadwa a sayid nggayirha, thlarɗi sa a far wal hǝrǝkrha.” Niya ndang nda kun, nanǝnya nun a wal nggayid Faara, nanǝnya ƙǝm far wal hǝrǝkrha.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝsad Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Mbǝ mid nan sǝ a tsawang nggan kowunni ǝn kii saara wa, ka amawa nanda ˈyar tar nan. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Amma a meyedghǝn, ahu ˈya nan a ǝnaarha heu nan kyad fad nan fa tarya Faara. Kan a ƙǝrǝsta tǝ sǝsaarha, tǝ ƙǝtǝlla, tǝ ɓillarha, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />tǝ sa ɗǝkrha fa, tǝ ƙǝnda hu porsǝna, tǝ wal wundǝrha fa, tǝ ƙǝtǝlla tǝ taara, tǝ yamid ɓeena, tǝ miirha, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />tǝ naarha chahal, tǝ sǝnda, tǝ ƙǝrǝssa tǝ nggayirha, hu Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda na tǝ kan ha, tǝ nggǝmnda, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />tǝ pǝr ƙǝkafekkirha, tǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara. Ƙǝs ɗan karid nggayirha ha a har yisǝma tǝ yikawa. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Kanda a manang nda kan, kanda ƙǝm a kyala tǝ kan, tǝ sǝɓang thlǝm nan ɗǝ, tǝ fal kan. Tǝrgha nda kan fa nggaɓaya ni, amma nan thlǝk ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Sǝn fiya kan, tǝr kan nda ƙǝla sǝngwanda kan wa, ƙǝla naghan a mii mǝra, ko nanǝn kee naghan tǝ yibrha fa, tsǝtsǝl nda kan, ko nanǝn kee ɓǝlang ngwanda kan wa, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />hu sǝbrha hura, parang kan tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa. Hu yamiiya, kan ƙǝm a ǝnang ƙǝna fiya hangga. Mbǝ ˈyasǝ a har nan wa, kan ni ƙǝm na tǝ ǝngya ha heu. <verse eid="2CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Kun Korontiyaya, pǝrang ɗan ƙǝkafek kun a pǝpal, tǝ ƙǝm na hur nan tsahai a kun. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ɓǝɓengwan hura kun wa, kun ndǝn ɓǝɓengga hura kan. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Niyi a ndikrha tǝ kun nanǝnya ƙǝla wanggina, kun ƙǝm inaman hur nun ɗǝ a kan.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝs thlǝmaarha aten ɗaharha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ma wum ɗun teena tǝ nafiya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek wa. Ƙǝƙǝn na tar nggayirha wumnda hai tǝ yi mbǝlfeerha? Nduwa, na kukwaryirha tsaurha tǝ wula? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Pashid Ƙǝrǝsti ni Sheetan wa? Na ˈyasǝ wumangga nafiya na a takkwa Chinǝm tǝ fingya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek wa? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Yanggi ɗǝfmee ni a pathlang nda ƙǝn Faara tǝ ɗaharha? Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝm wuri Faara ni na tǝ yibrha fa. Ƙǝla ndana Faara, “Niya tsaurha tǝ kanda ha, wii hai ƙǝm ahur ndan, niya tsaurha Faara a kanda, kanda ƙǝm tsawa nda nafina.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edzekiyel 37.27; 1 Kor 3.16; 6.19</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Tsaunǝn kee, “Kyama sǝ ahur ndan, wura man fad nun ɗǝ ma kanda, Chinǝm ndǝn ndagha kee, A tsuwar ɗun ˈya fa na tǝ paarha fa wa, nggi ƙǝm niya thlǝ kun fa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ish 52:11</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />tsawi china a kun, kun ƙǝm tsawun wanggina nda hǝshya tǝ nishya, Chinǝm na tǝ sǝsǝmnda ha heu ndǝn ndagha kee.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sam 7.14; 1 Tar 17.13; Ish 43.6; Irm 31.9</char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Tsaunǝn kee Shayina, nanǝn nǝghǝm tǝ ɗǝfmi yini ya, ƙǝl a tsawum chahal ma ǝngya mbuwa chahal na sǝɓang fad nǝm ɗǝ, tǝ sǝsǝna ƙǝm. Taama tsawum lǝlǝgɗa chahal na a fǝrang mamnggirha Faara.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wutsǝfayid Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Niya ndang nda kun inaman hur nun kanɗǝ. Mbǝ niifa sǝ ǝnang nan aibe fa wa, mbǝ niifa sǝ sǝɓang nan ˈya fa wa, mbǝ niifa sǝ huk nan wa. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ndawi kee ka a fǝrang aibe ni kun wa. Ƙǝsǝr ˈwaɗi teena pǝrang ɗi ndǝn kun nggǝm ɗan kun kaan, mbǝ ˈyasǝ na ndǝghang ƙǝm hai wa, ko hu mǝra ni, mǝrǝm kyab nduwa wal yibrha kyab. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nggǝmɗi fa tǝ kun kaan, niyi a taala tǝ kun kaan. Walɗi kaali kaan. Hu sǝsad nan heu niyi lǝlǝgɗa tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="2CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ko a sayidɗi ɓanan chehweed makidoniya ɓa, yib wan wa, amma wal ɓillarha kan kaan, a ƙǝshi kakyathlanga, ahur yi nan hǝreenga. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Amma Faara, ndǝghǝn na fǝrang kaali fiya na tǝ sǝbrha hura, wal ɗan kaali tǝ ɓad Titus ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Mbǝ ka ɓad Titus ɓa kee ndǝn nan a ǝna wutsǝfayirha wa, amma walɗǝ kaali a fad nun. Pǝrang ɗa ndǝn kan tǝ ndaarha na mid nun sǝ na nggi, tǝ sǝbrha hura ǝnanun aten ǝnggini katǝragha hai, tǝ fǝr ten nun na a ɗeewun sǝ. Ən ɗani ya nggǝrgha fǝree wutsǝfayirha kaan. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ƙǝsǝr ko sǝɓang ni hur nun ɗǝ hu ɗeleewar ɗi chireethleng ni kun ɗǝ, ǝnawi masǝnɗi kee tǝghǝn wa, ko nanǝn kaar ǝnaɗi masǝnɗi kee, ƙǝla ni hai ɗeleewar ɗi sǝɓang ɗǝ hur nun ɗǝ, amma yi ɓeena ni ngguchit kee. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Nanǝnya niyi tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa, mbǝ ka sǝɓang ni hur nun ɗǝ wa, ƙǝl sǝbrha hur nun kyang ɗǝ kun hu kwamana hai. Amma sǝbrha hura ǝnanun ndǝn malang nun ɗimiyid nun, ƙǝsǝr tur yanɗa ni na mid Faara a nagha nafiyighǝn tǝghǝn fa, nanǝn kee ǝnang ngwa ˈya kun fa mbuwa ngga wa. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝbrha hura yi tǝrǝm Faara ndǝna kyang niifa hu mal ɗimiyirha hai wal hǝrǝkrha nǝn, mbǝ masǝnɗi kee sǝ wa, amma sǝbrha hura yi ƙǝshiirha nǝn ɓang mǝrra ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Tur yanɗi sǝbrha hura ya nǝghǝn hu kwamana na mid Faara. Ɓangga ˈya kun ɓa na ngga, kyang ɗǝ kun hu ǝna ǝngya hai na ngga, na mid nun sǝ kyaɗang nda fiya ǝnaɗun ˈya mǝmǝl. Sǝb hur nun ɗǝ aten ɗimiyirha. Na mid nun sǝ a ǝna ˈya nun ndaana Faara. Na mid nun sǝ nggǝr ǝna ˈya na ngga. Na mid nun sǝ a ǝna ˈya nun mbǝnangga Faara. Na mid nun sǝ a tsǝtsǝl kowunni nun ǝnagha aibe. A hu ǝnggini heu ya kyad ɗun ndaarha nuwun tǝ ƙǝkafek fa. Ənaɗun ǝngya heu kamngga hu palthɗiya. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />ˈYa ǝnagha ndǝn chireethleng ni kun ɗǝ, mbǝ a ten niifɗi ǝnagha aibe wa nduwa ƙǝm aten niifɗi ǝnang nanda aibe fa wa, amma a kyaɗang nggǝnda kun a mbed Faara hu fǝr alten nun a kan ǝnanun. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Hu ǝnggini heu ya wal ɗan kaali. Hu chighǝd kaali ɗi wal nan, tǝk ɗan mbǝnda fa nanan Titus a ǝna wutsǝfayirha, ƙǝsǝr ka kun heu fǝrangga kaali, huna hurghǝn hai. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ƙǝsǝr ko ndang ni, niyi a taala tǝ kun, fǝree wun shilee wa. Ƙǝla ni naarha pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kyadɗǝ ndaarha taala niya ǝnani a tennun a Titus ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Nanǝn kee nggǝmnda Titus aten nun nǝghǝn aten chikrha, kala sayidɗi nǝn ɗal teena hai tǝ kun hu mamnggirha nun fǝrang nda, tǝƙǝm thlǝnun ndǝn fa tǝ ɗa shilee hai tǝ fǝr mamnggirha kaan. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Niyi tǝ wutsǝfayirha, ƙǝsǝr mbǝrsaɗi tǝ kun kaan.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Fǝra tǝ hura tsahai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Nanǝnya shayina, na minnan sǝ a sǝn ǝn ɗanun ɓang na nggayid Faara hu ƙǝn hwan Faara nafiya Makidoniyaya ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝtǝl nda fa kaan hu sǝsaarha kya nanda sahai, amma ka nana nda tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa kaan ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn fǝr nanda tǝ hura tsahai, ko nanǝn fa yamiya ni kanda kaan. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗisǝ fǝrgha nda hu ˈya na nanda tǝghǝn ha, har kalgha kanda mu. Kanda tǝ fad ndan, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />hwanda kan kaan ka a wal kwaman fǝra nda ka ɗang ngganda nafiya Faara sǝ. Tǝna nda wal kwaman kyarha hur nafiya hai na a thlar nafiya na chahal na hu chehweed Yahudaya. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Kalɗǝ ˈya kya nǝm shiteena atenggǝn, katǝrang ngganda ˈwa fǝr alten ndan a Chinǝm, tǝrgha a fǝr alten ndanda a kan ƙǝla na mid Faara a ǝna nda. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ƙǝla nan hai kee hwan ɗan Titus ƙǝla ˈwanǝn katǝrang hai, a ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ ngwalanggǝn ǝna tar nggayidɗi ahur nun. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Tsaunǝn nuwun a ǝna ˈya ngga kiya hu fǝrƙǝkafek, hu laɓaara, hu sǝnda, tǝ njiteena, tǝ nggǝmndǝ nun a kan, ƙǝl a ɗun mbeeɗǝ tǝ ǝna tar nggayidɗi ya ƙǝm. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Mbiyi a ndaarha tsauɗǝ tǝta a ǝnaghǝnun wa, amma nana minna sǝ a ƙǝƙǝrang nggi ƙǝkafekkid nggǝmndǝ nun ni, tǝ ƙǝƙǝrang nda djiten fingya. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗun nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, ko nanǝn tǝ ƙǝnani, tsauɗǝ tǝ yamirha ƙǝsǝr ka kun, ƙǝsǝr hu yamidghǝn, ndǝnun a tsaurha tǝ ƙǝna ha. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Kulo ˈya niya ndang nda kun ya. A kwasarha, kun ˈwagha fǝra, nggǝr wun tsaurha nafiya ˈwagha djiteena tǝ ǝnaghǝn. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Nanǝnya ngwalaman tarɗi katǝrang nun hai. Djiteena kyad nun a katǝradghǝn a mǝmǝlgha tǝ fǝrrǝnun. Fǝrama ˈya kamngga tǝ wallǝ nun ha. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ƙǝsǝr anaɗǝ tǝ nggǝmnda hur nun, na nda a thlǝ fǝrrǝɗi, hu ˈya nana niifa tǝghǝn ha, mbǝ hu ˈya ƙǝm mbuwa na niifa tǝghǝn ha wa. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mbǝ niyi a ndaarha a ɗang ngganda fingya sǝ kun a ƙǝtǝlla fa wa, amma ka a nagha ˈya mǝmǝl, <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />nanǝnya ana ˈyasǝ a harnun ƙǝl thlar fingya yina nun tǝ ˈya na mid ndan. Tǝna nda thlar kun hu wallǝ ndan ha tǝ ˈya na mid nun a fara sǝmǝn ƙǝm, a mbǝɗiya komani mǝmǝlɗǝ, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />kǝla nanǝn chichireethlee hai tǝ ndaarha, “Yanɗi wumangga hai hangga, wumang ngwa hai kalgha ˈya na midghǝn wa, yanɗi wumangga hai ngguchit ƙǝm, ƙǝɗeng ngwa ˈya na midghǝn wa.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝnda Titus a Koronti ɗǝ ɗǝgha thlǝ ǝnɗa ɓa fǝr nanda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Usaɗi Faara, ƙǝsǝr ka nggayidghǝn tsawang nǝn hur Titus mǝmǝl kǝla na mid na ǝnaarha a kun. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Mbǝ nggǝm nǝn fa tǝ hwandǝ nan kee wa, amma tǝrna midghǝn ɗǝrha thlǝmad nun ɗǝ tafadghǝn. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ƙǝlama hai ya thlǝnang ɗan shad nan ɗǝ a samadghǝn, falna nafiya ƙǝn hwan Faara heu ka targhǝn yi pǝr Laɓar Faara nǝn a ǝnaarha. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Wurna fiya ndǝn na ahu ƙǝn hwan Faara nagha a takkwa kan ahu ǝna tar nggayidɗi nanan a ǝnaarha ƙǝsǝr ka manang nda thlǝm Chinǝm, tǝ kyad djiten nan yi thlaara. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Naghan a ɗa ˈyaara hai, tǝ kwamanɗi nan a ǝnaarha tǝ fǝrrǝɗi. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ƙǝsǝr na minnan sǝ a ǝna ˈya nan mǝmǝl mbǝ a mbed Chinǝm kee wa amma a mbed fiya ƙǝm. <verse eid="2CO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Naghan ƙǝm a thlǝnang tahad shad nan ɗǝ a samad nafini sǝri ya. Saara hangga kan a ƙǝƙǝrang targhǝn, na taara a kukwasang fa tǝ ƙǝm na ƙǝkafek sǝ a fadghǝn. Nǝghǝn a kukwasang fa kaan a ɗǝgha thlǝmad nun ɗǝ ka a thlar kun nǝn, ƙǝsǝr ka nǝn fa mbǝrsa nǝn tǝ kun. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titus ƙǝm, pashid tarna ni ahur nun, ƙǝla fingya shayi nan, thlǝn nanda kanda hu ƙǝngya hwan Faara ɗǝ, yi manang nda Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Tsaunǝn kee, kyaɗaama tur nggǝmndǝ ɗi nanun tǝghǝn ha a nafini ya a ƙǝngya hwan Faara heu, tǝ ndaarha ƙǝm taala nan a ǝnaarha a tennun ƙǝkafek ni.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Thlaara a nafiya Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Mbǝ ƙǝl chirethleng ni kun ɗǝ aten thlaara a nafiya Faara na chahal a Urshalima wa, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />sǝnɗisǝ nǝghǝn a kukwasang kun fa a furun. Niyi a taala atenggǝn a nafiya na a chehweed Makidoniya. Niyi a ndaarha, “Nafiya Faara na a chehweed Akaya ngwanda fa ka a kwasarha a fǝr yi ndan thlaara nda.” Tur djiten ɗi nanun tǝghǝn ya thleng ɗǝ fingya sǝ hangga. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Amma niya thlǝnang shayina ɗǝ ya, ƙǝsǝr naɗǝ tallǝ nan aten nun tsaurha mere, tǝnun tsaurha nggungwa fa, ƙǝla ndani aten nun. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ƙǝsǝr a ɓad nafiya Makidoniya ɓa a samadna, ɓagha wal kun ngwa wun fa wa, na shilee a ƙǝsang kan, sakwata kun, ƙǝsǝr ka nggǝm nan fa tǝ kun. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Tsaunǝn kee, niyi a numarha kamɗǝ a hwan shayina nan ya a weng tala nda kun kapa na sayidɗi ɓarhaɓa, ka a ngwalang ngganda ngwarha fa aten fǝra tǝ hura tsahai ɗǝf nun mee kaman nggǝn. A tsauka fǝrrǝɗi tǝ hura tsahai mbǝ tǝ ngyabrha wa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faara na midghǝn tǝ fǝra tǝ wutsǝfayirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Ɗalama teena hai tǝ laɓarɗiya, “Amma kala niifa hǝfgha ngguchit nǝn hathla ngguchit, amma kala niifa hǝfgha hangga, nǝn hathlang hai hangga.” <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kowunni ahur nun fǝrgha ƙǝla tǝrna hurghǝn, mbǝ tǝ ndaarha a sǝnɗi kee wa nduwa tǝ ngyabrha wa, ƙǝsǝr Faara na midghǝn tǝ fǝra tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Na Faara a fǝrang parka kun hangga kalgha ˈya na mid nun, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝtsar a wal kala ǝngya nun hangga na mid nun ǝnaarha hu ǝna taara na ngga. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Ƙǝla nanǝn chichirethlee hai hu Ɗeleewar Faara, “Hu fǝra na harghǝn tsahai, fǝrang ɗǝ fa yamiya tǝ haara tsahai, nggayidghǝn mbǝ tam ngwalarha wa.” <verse eid="2CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Faara ndǝna a fǝr wiirha a tǝ hǝfrha, ndǝghǝn ni na a fǝr ǝnnarhami ka a hǝɓǝm, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm nǝn a fǝrang kun nggǝrghǝn chik wallu nun ha, halth nggayirha nun hangga. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ƙǝtsar na Faara fǝrang ƙǝna kun hu kwamangya hangga, tǝnun fǝra tǝ haara tsahai kala sayi. Nanǝn kee fiya hangga na nda a usa Faara hu fǝra nun a thlǝnang kanda ɗǝ a harnan. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Tarɗi nun a ǝnaarha ya, mbǝ ka a ɗanggǝn nafiya Faara sǝ na chahal katen ndan wa, amma na fiya hangga a chik usarha a Faara. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Tar nggayidɗi kyanun ya, kyad nǝn fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun ni, na fingya a manang thlǝm Faara ƙǝsǝr nggǝm ɗun fa tǝ laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti, ƙǝmɗa ƙǝsǝr ka fǝrrǝnun haara tsahai ǝnang nun kanda tǝ fingya. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kanda ƙǝm nanda a hwanang Faara kun sǝ, na nda naarha ɗal kun teena ƙǝsǝr ka nggayid Faara kalgha mbǝrha mu kyaɗang nǝn kun. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Taama usa Faara nǝm ƙǝsǝr ka nggayid fǝrrǝghǝn kalgha mbǝrha mu!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Kal Mbulus sǝ aten targhǝn hu ƙǝn hwan Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nggi Mbulus tafadna niya hwan kun tǝ sammayirha tǝ hakkilo tur yi Ƙǝrǝsti, nggi na nda aarha, “Ɓayirha” a naɗi a thlǝmad nun, amma, “tǝ ndeethla” a mbi a thlǝmad nun wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Niya hwan kun a nggehe ɗun hu ngyangthlanggirha hai a ɓa ɗi ɓa wa, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗisǝ niya naarha ngyangthlang aten nafini na a numarha tǝ ndaarha ǝnɗi nan a ǝnaarha ya yi ƙǝshiirha ni. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ko nanǝn nǝghǝm hu ƙǝshiirha, mban a yanda ƙǝla na ƙǝshiirha ǝnaarha wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ƙǝsǝr karid yanda nanan tǝghǝn ha, mbǝ karid yanda ƙǝshiirha ni wa, yi sǝsǝmnda Faara ni, na changgǝlang mbǝya hai na ƙǝkanglang tǝ ngaala yi nggaɓarha. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Kan nan changgǝlang kala ˈya hai na ˈyaɗa sǝnda Faara, nan wuɗang kala tur yanggi huteena ɓa nagha a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya ndaana Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Naghan nggungwa fa ƙǝm a tsǝtsǝl kowunni nan kargha ǝna taara fa tǝ ˈya ndaana Ƙǝrǝsti, a hǝrǝm ɗun lǝɗang ˈya ndaana Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nuwun a ƙǝlang ǝnɗi na yid nun a naarha kee. A nggǝm niifa fa tǝ ndaarha ndǝghǝn nggi yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni, ngwa ngǝrgha numarha ngga, ƙǝla nanǝn yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni, kan ƙǝm nan kee. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Nanǝn kee, ko ǝnani taala aten sǝsǝmnggid ɗi fǝrang na Chinǝm kan ka a ɗang nggan kun sǝ, mbǝ waleng nggan kun ɗǝ wa, mbǝ shilee a ƙǝseerha wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Mbǝ minnasǝ a nzǝmnggǝnun tǝ ndaarha nana minna sǝ a tǝrmang nggi kun tǝ ɗeleewar yina wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha fingya, “Ɗeleewar yighǝn na nda haaghǝn tǝ shembe kaan, amma a ƙǝma ɗun hai yirha tǝ yirha mbǝ hǝhasasǝ sǝ a fadghǝn wa, tǝ ƙǝm mbǝ ˈya sǝ hu laɓarghǝn wa.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Tur nafiniya kamɗǝ a sǝna nda sǝ tǝ ndaarha ˈya nanan a thlǝkrha hu ɗeleewar nan a sayidɗi mbuwa nan a thlǝmad ndan, ndǝghǝn ɗani nan a thlǝkrha a sayidɗi nanan a thlǝmad ndan. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ƙǝsǝr kan ɓilla wan na a mǝmǝlang nggan fad nan tǝ fingya na mindan puwang fad ndan mbeeɗǝ wa. Amma tur fingya na ƙǝƙǝrang fad ndan tǝ ndan, tǝ ƙǝm mǝmǝlang ngganda fad ndan tǝ ndan, mba nda ndǝndǝl wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Amma kan mban taala kal mbǝra nǝn mu wa, ƙǝl nan taala tǝ taara kyaɗang na Faara kan a pǝpal, wumngga heu tǝ kun ƙǝm <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Mban ɗǝrha ɗǝ inggun hu taala wa, ƙǝla ˈwa wan weng tala kun wa, ƙǝsǝr kan ˈwagha ɗǝrha thlǝmad nun ɗǝ tǝ Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn yi Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Mban taala kalgha mbǝrha mu ahu taara ǝnana fingya wa. Amma nan a shiteena nana fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun aten chikrha, na tar nan a chik ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ a pathlang nun ƙǝm, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />tǝnan mbang pǝr laɓar Faara hu chehweeya na inggun ma kun. Ƙǝsǝr mban taala aten taara ˈwana nda ǝnaarha a mbǝd tar niifa wa. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Amma, “Kala niifa na a taala, tǝta ni a talgha tǝ Chinǝm.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ niifa na a fal fadghǝn ndǝn na nda nggǝm fa tǝghǝn wa, ƙǝl yanɗi fal na Chinǝm.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Mbulus tǝ fa thlǝngya Yeeso fa nggaɓaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Niyi a shiteena tǝ ndaarha ƙǝrsaama tǝ nuryid na. Ƙǝrsaama tǝ nggi! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Niya sǝrǝkrha aten nun ƙǝla na Faara sǝrǝkrha. Nuwun ƙǝla wuronga ɗǝf ni miina nun a kakh chimarha tal, ndǝna Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Amma niyi a tǝrǝmnda, nǝn ɗǝ naarha ƙǝla kyaɗang na huthne ndǝndǝlyid nggaɓaarha Hauwawu, naɗǝ numad nun sakhɗang kun malanggun ƙǝkafekkid ˈya na chahal ndaana a Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ƙǝsǝr nun yakh thlǝ nafiya fa pǝpa na ɓang laɓar Yeeso kun ɓa pak ma yanɗi Yeeso pǝrang nan kun, nduwa thlǝ sǝsǝna nun pak ma sǝsǝn ɗi thlǝnun, nduwa Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn ma yanɗi ˈwa nun thlǝrha a har nan. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Mbiyi a numad ndaarha nafini nun aarha “Mamngya fathlǝngya Yeeso” kal nda nggi wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ko nanǝn tsahe wanda kwaman ndikrha ha wa, niyi tǝ sǝnda. Kyaɗang ɗan ǝnɗi kun ˈyahu kwamangya hangga. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Pǝrang ɗi Laɓar Faara kun na Mbǝnggǝn tǝka. Manang ngwi tenna wa, ƙǝsǝr ka a manang ngganda kun. Ənaɗi ɗimi wa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Nani a ǝna taara tǝ kun, na fingya ƙǝn hwan Faara ɗeesǝ, nǝn naarha ƙǝla niya fasa kanda ka a ǝnang taara ni kun tǝka. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />A sayidɗi nani a thlǝmad nun ɓillayi kun a ɗeewun sǝ ana minna wuɗǝɓǝla wa. Fa takkwaya ɓagha ɓa a Makidoniya fǝreenda ˈya na minna. Tsauki ɓillarha a kun kaar wa, tǝƙǝm mbi tam tsaurha ɓillarha a kun wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ƙǝla nana ƙǝkafekkid Ƙǝrǝsti ahur na, mbǝ niifasǝ hu chehweed Akaya heu na mbang ndeerha a malang nggi taala wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Kama nda niya ndaarha kee? Nggǝmngwa ni kun wa? Sǝn Faara sǝ nggǝmɗi kun.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Niya ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ ǝna ˈya ni yakh ǝnaarha. Tǝni ˈyaɗang kwamana nafina fa na a ndaarha na nda mǝmǝl tǝ kan hu ǝnggini na nda a taala atenggǝn. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Nafiniya fa nggaɓaya fathlǝngya Yeeso ni, na nda a nggaɓa fiya hai hu tar ndan, tǝrgha nda fad ndan ƙǝla fathlǝngya Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ma wulang teena kun wa, ƙǝsǝr ko sheetan ni tǝ altenggǝn tǝrɗǝ fadghǝn ƙǝla tǝthlǝnda kukwaryirha ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Ƙǝsǝr kakee, mbǝ ǝnwulteena ni wa, a tǝr mafayighǝn fad ndan hai ƙǝla mafaya nggayirha. A mii ngwaladghǝn na nda a wal ƙǝnaghǝn mǝmǝl tǝ ˈya ǝnana nda.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝsad Mbulus ka Ƙǝrǝsti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Niya nggǝr thlǝkƙǝn, a tǝr niifa nggi nura ni wa. Amma a tǝrɗun nggi kee, ƙǝl thlǝ nggi nun fa ƙǝla nun thlǝ nura fa, ƙǝsǝr tǝni taala ngguchit. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Ahu taala niya ǝnaarha, mbiyi a kaala sǝ ƙǝla na Chinǝm ǝnaarha wa, a meyedghǝn niyi a ndikrha fa ƙǝla yi nuryirha. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Tsaunǝn fiya hangga a taala tur yi thlu farha, nggi ƙǝm niya ǝnaarha kee. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ƙǝsǝr kun nuwun ndǝndǝl kaan, amma kun a tsaurhahu wutsǝfayirha tǝ nurya. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ƙǝkafek, kun a mbang tsaurha tǝ niifa kyangga kun hu tar mafayirha hai, nduwa huk kun nǝn, nduwa tsǝgha hasǝ tǝ kun, nduwa tǝranggǝn tenggǝn sǝ, nduwa mbi kun nǝn hu ƙǝmeegha.<verse eid="2CO 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Na shilee ƙǝseerha a ndaɗi ƙǝɗi ɗan ma ǝna ǝnggina nan ya, ana niifasǝ na a taala aten ˈya nggi ƙǝm ni ǝnaarha kee, niyi a ndikrha fa ƙǝla nura. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Nafiya Ibraniyaya ni kanda wa? Nggi ƙǝm niyi kee. Nafiya Isǝreelaya ni kanda wa? Nggi ƙǝm niyi kee. Turya Ibrahim ni kanda wa? Nggi ƙǝm niyi kee. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Mafaya Ƙǝrǝsti ni kanda wa? Niyi a ndikrha fa ƙǝla tǝpabirha, amma kalɗi kanda tsaurha ka mafarha. Kalɗi kanda ǝna taara kaan, ƙǝnenda hu porsǝna saara hangga, saaɗi ɗǝkrha fa tǝ wutǝteerha, tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝtsar takhɗi a mǝra saara hangga. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Sara tuf tsaɗa na Yahudaya nggi tǝ wutǝteerha kumnggit mahan kap wutarihe. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Sara mahan kanda a ɗǝk nggi tǝ sǝsaala, sara tal kanda a mbǝmba nggi tǝ ferya. Sara mahan nggirggi aama timɗa hai, nggi ahurghǝn. ˈWaɗi mǝnda pari hu wuri aama. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ƙǝtsar nggi hu wiirha, sǝsaaɗi tǝ aam afa afa tǝ ƙǝm a haar fa fasa faaya, sǝsaaɗi a har nafina Yahudaya tǝ nafiya mbuwa Yahudaya, sǝsaaɗi hu wupǝriya, sǝsaaɗi a kaheerha, sǝsaaɗi hu wuri aama, sǝsaaɗi a har nafiya ndagha fǝr nda ƙǝkafek ashe fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya fa nggaɓaya ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ƙǝtǝl ɗi fa kaan, kulo yamid shibeena saara hangga. Saaɗi miirha fa tǝ hushimnda, saara hangga ni naarha kula ǝnnarhami. Ƙǝse mbiirha saara hangga tǝ yamid ǝn kaala fa. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ma fingya yini ya, kala parra fara ni ɓillarha tǝ laf fa takkwaya hu ƙǝn hwan Faara heu. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Wunni mbuwa tǝ shembe, tǝkkwa ni yamid shembedghǝn fa? Wunni kyagha hu ɗimiyirha hai ɓillawa nggi fa? <verse eid="2CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />A ǝna ɗi taala, niyi a taala aten fingya ǝngya kyadgha yamid shembed na. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Faara chin Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, tsauna faala ka manggǝn pakwanɗǝ, sǝnɗasǝ mbǝ nggaɓarha niya thlǝkrha wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />A Ndimaska ngwamna ɗi na a kamu kutǝra Aretis, ɗǝf ɗǝ nafiya a kwakirǝm wupǝri Ndimaska ƙǝsǝr a ƙǝseegha nda, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />amma ɗǝfeegha nda hu kutasa hai fǝr nggi nda hai tǝ kwad halth maana yi Ndimaska hǝryi ma ndǝghǝn.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Əngya kyaɗang na Chinǝm Yeeso Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Tsawee ɗafa tǝta a ɗi mbeeɗǝ tǝ ǝna taala. Ko nanǝn mbǝ a ɗeesǝ wa, niya ndikrha aten ǝngya keɗee na Chinǝm ƙǝla sǝsǝniirha tǝ ǝngya na ɓǝɓee. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Sǝnɗi niifa hu Ƙǝrǝsti huraya kumkap faɗa mbǝrgha ɗǝ tǝrang nanda talara ɗǝ yi mahan. Ko hu farha ko mbǝ hu farha wa, mbi sǝnda wa, ƙǝl Faara ndǝn sǝngga ndǝn. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ƙǝla ndaani, sǝnɗi niifɗiya, ko hu farha ni, ko mbǝ hu farha wa, mbi sǝnda wa, amma Faara ndǝn sǝngga ndǝn, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />kula sǝndǝghǝnsǝ tǝrangga Faara a mbǝrha ɗǝ na ngga a talara. Sǝkɗǝ ǝngya mbuwa nǝn mbang thlǝkrha, tur ǝnggini mbuwa na niifa mbang kalasǝ atenggǝn. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ni taala aten niifɗiya, amma mbi taala a altenna wa, ƙǝl aten yamid shembed na. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ƙǝsǝr ko nana mid na taala, mbi tsaurha nura wa, ƙǝsǝr kǝkafek ndǝn niya thlǝkrha. Amma mbiya ndikrha kaan atenggǝn wa, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ minna sǝ a falgha niifa nggi ma ˈya nanǝn hu tsawud na wa, nduwa sǝk nǝn ahu laɓar na wa.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ƙǝsǝr ni ɗǝ taala tǝ ǝnwultenggini keɗee na nda, thlǝnǝn nda ndaha ɓa hu thlu fadna, tǝthlǝnda Sheetan ni thlǝnna nda ɓa ka ɓagha sǝseerha tǝ ƙǝm ˈyaɗe taala nǝn fa. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Katǝra mahan nggi a hwan Faara ka a ndǝgheghǝn hai tǝghǝn. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Amma nggǝreghǝn sǝ, “Nggayid na tsuwoɗǝ, sǝsǝmnggit na nǝghǝn manggǝn hu yamid shembe.” Tsaunǝn kee, niya nggǝr taala kaan tǝ wutsǝfayirha aten yamid shembed na, tǝna sǝsǝmnggit Ƙǝrǝsti tsaurha a tenna. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Tsaunǝn kee, nggǝmɗi fa tǝ yamid shembed na, tǝ ˈyaara, hu ƙǝtǝlla fa, hu sǝsaarha, hu ɓillarha ƙǝsǝr ka Ƙǝrǝsti. A sayidɗi mbuwa ni tǝ shembe, hu sayidɗa ni, ni naarha tǝ shembe.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓillad Mbulus ka fa takkwaya na a Koronti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ənaɗi nuryirha, amma kunni keegha sahai. Kunni ƙǝm kamngga a fal nggi nun. Ko nanǝn mbiyi a mii ˈya wa, tsauka tǝ ndaarha mamngya fa takkwaya Yeeso na yinun kal nda nggi wa. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Tsaunǝn kee, ǝnaɗi ǝnwultengya hangga ahur nun, ƙǝrǝs ni hu ǝna tar na. Ənwultenggini ya pǝr ndan tǝ ndaarha nggi tǝthlǝnda Yeeso ni yi ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Hu yanggi kwamanggi ni kyadgha ndaarha mbuwun tal tǝ fingya ƙǝn hwan Faara? Ƙǝsǝr ka karang ni kun fa a thlar ɗun nggi tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla wa? Nanǝn kee, chehema ɗimid ɗaɗǝ ya! <verse eid="2CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Nanǝnya, ngwaɗi fa na weng tala ni kun yi mahan. Mbiya ƙǝtǝlang kun wa, ƙǝsǝr kun ndǝna minna, mbǝ wuɗǝɓǝl nun wa. Kamngwa wundakhnaya tǝr rǝfǝd chinggindan nda wa, amma chingya ndǝna tǝr rǝfǝd wanggindan. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Nanǝn kee, ni tǝk mbǝnda fa a ɓǝlang ɗi ˈya nani tǝghǝn ha heu tǝ altenna ka a ɗanggi kun sǝ. A nggǝmɗi kun kaan, nun thlahang nggǝmndǝ ɗa haɗǝ wa? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Nun a nggǝm fa tǝ nggi, tǝ ndaarha tsaukwi haghǝn a kun wa. Amma na niifa ndaarha ǝnang ni thlǝrɓuyirha kun, wal yi kun tǝ kwaman nggaɓaarha. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />A hur nafini thlǝnang ni kun ɗǝ na yanɗa sǝ hukka kun wa? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Hwanɗi Titus a ɗǝgha thlǝman nun ɗǝ, thlǝnɗi wanma nǝm ɗǝ a samadghǝn. Nduwa huk na Titus kun wa? Mbǝ Sǝsǝna tal na a laf ƙǝm wa? Mbǝ kwamana tal nǝm a takkwarha wa? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Nuwun a numad ndaarha nan a thlang fad nan sǝ a har nun wa? Awo, naghan a ndikrha ƙǝla na mid Ƙǝrǝsti ndiyim a mbed Faara. Shayina nggǝm ni, kala ˈya nǝm a ǝnaarha, nan a ǝnaghǝn ka a ɗanggǝn kun sǝ. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ƙǝsǝr niyi a tǝrǝmnda, a ɓaɗiɓa, mbi ɓa wal kun ƙǝla na minna wa, kun ƙǝm mbun ɓa wal nggi ƙǝla na mid nun wa. Niyi a tǝrǝmnda asǝmha nagha yanda sǝ, tǝ sǝrǝkrha, tǝ hufrha hura kaan, tǝ nggǝm alteena, tǝ sǝb thlǝma, tǝ kiki ndan, tǝ manang alteena, tǝ kakyathlanga. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Niya tǝrǝmnda a nggǝr ɗi wutta thlǝmad nun ɗǝ, na Faar na a tse ngguchit a mbed nun, tǝ ƙǝm sǝbgha hurna ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ka fingya ǝnagha ɗimiyirha kaar, malang ngwanda ɗimiyid ndan wa, ǝn tsanda, tǝ ǝna kulafayirha, tǝ ǝn shilee kyana nda sahai.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Nggǝlmi ƙǝs thlǝmad Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Yanɗiya ndǝna wii tal na yi mahan a thlǝmad nun ɗǝ. Ƙǝla ndaana ɗeleewar Faara, “Tǝta ni a kyagha ˈya ɓa a mii shedawaya sǝri nduwa mahan.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Hu wii tal na yi sǝri ˈwaɗi teena ƙǝsɗi thlǝmad nafini ǝnagha ɗimiyirha tǝ fingya heu a malangganda ǝna ɗimiyirha. Nanǝnya mbuwani a thlǝmad nun, niya nggǝr ƙǝs thlǝmad nun, ƙǝsǝr a ɓaɗiɓa mbǝ niifa sǝ hǝrǝkrha ma tsǝtsǝlla wa. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Na minnun sǝ a kyaɗang ndaarha ni kun na Ƙǝrǝsti a ndikrha tǝ nggi. Mbǝ ƙǝɗeng nǝn shembe hu ǝn ǝnadghǝn a fad nun wa, amma nǝghǝn tǝ sǝsǝmnda fa ahur nun. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ko tawang na nda ɗǝ hu yamid shembe aten kaɗiirha, amma tǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara ni nanǝn tǝ yibrha fa. Ko nanǝn mbǝm tǝ shembe ahurghǝn wa, amma tǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara nǝm a tsaurha tǝghǝn ahu taara nan a ǝnaarha a kun. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ƙǝƙǝraman fad nun ko nuwun a takkwa Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ ƙǝkafek, nama naarha ƙǝƙǝrang nda fad nun. Sǝnggunsǝ tǝ ndaarha na Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ahur nun wa? Amma a mbǝ Ƙǝrǝsti ahur nun wa, tsauɗǝ fǝlɗun hai hu ƙǝƙǝrrǝɗi. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Niyi a shiteena nun a sǝndasǝ fǝlwum hai hu ƙǝƙǝrɗi wa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Amma naghan a hwan Faara nun ɗǝ ǝna ˈya mbuwa ngga. Mbǝ ka a nagha fiya ndǝn tsauka ƙǝla pedna fad nan hu ƙǝƙǝrrǝɗi wa, amma a sǝnunsǝ ǝnaɗun ǝnɗi kamngga, ko nanǝn asǝmha nǝghǝm a naghǝn fǝlɗǝm hai. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm ǝnang nda ƙǝkafek fa wa, amma ƙǝl a ƙǝkafek kee. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Nan naarha tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa a mban tǝ shembe fa wa, amma kun nuwun tǝ shembe fa. Naghan a hwan Faara a tsawun lǝlǝgɗa ƙǝla nanun kaar. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ndǝghǝn ɗani niya chireethleng ǝnggini kun hai ya nggi kula naarha a thlǝmad nun, ƙǝsǝr a ɓaɗiɓa, nǝn ɓa tsawee fa ne ngyangthlang a kun ni tǝ sǝsǝmndǝɗi fǝree na Faara a fǝrang kaali ni kun, mbǝ a weleng nggi kun ɗǝ wa.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mii ngwala nda ǝn Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />A mii ngwaladghǝn shayina, ƙǝl fara sǝmǝn. Djitima tsawun lǝlǝgɗa ƙǝla nanun kaar. Sǝghama hwandǝna. A tsauka numan nun tal tǝ ndan, tsawama ɗǝɗem tǝ ndan, hu tsaurha kiya Faara na tǝ nggǝmnda tǝ ɗǝɗemnggirha nǝn tsaurha tǝ kun. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ndaman ˈya ndan fa tǝ fǝbrha yi nggǝmnda na chahal. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Nafiya Faara na chahal heu a ndangˈya kun fa. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ngwa tsauka nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, tǝ nggǝmnda Faara, tǝ wumten tsawud ɗǝɗemnggit Sǝsǝna Tǝ peɗǝnda tsauka tǝ kun heu.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>